2	Finalising risk scenarios & inputs	Drafted preliminary DRP and threat trees
3	Peer review & editing executive draft	Improved structure, added mitigation tables

📌 My Role: I led the documentation, recorded meeting minutes, and created initial drafts for the peer-reviewed risk charts.

🧠 Learning Point: These meetings reinforced my ability to collaborate remotely, assign roles effectively, and communicate risk in business language.

