🔄 4. Key Risk Decision Example

📌 Scenario: Whether to implement basic 2FA or invest in biometric authentication

🗳️ Meeting Vote Result:

2FA: 3 votes (cost-effective, easy rollout)

Biometrics: 2 votes (better security, high cost)

🔁 Decision: Go with 2FA, with a roadmap to biometrics in future phases

📬 Reflection: This decision showed how risk appetite, budget, and timeline intersect in real-world planning.

